Given that Field_1 has the highest threat level and is partially protected already (2 drones are protecting, 2 are flying in), our priority will remain there. The best strategy is to ensure Field_1 is fully protected first. 

Since 2 drones are already protecting Field_1 and 2 are on their way, we will wait for those drones to arrive, keeping all drones protecting Field_1 as they can work together to fend off the birds.

